954">cannot </span><span begin="00:39.954" end="00:40.322">help </span><span begin="00:40.322" end="00:40.676">but </span><span begin="00:40.676" end="00:41.858">stay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.682" end="00:46.794"><span begin="00:44.682" end="00:45.034">Just </span><span begin="00:45.034" end="00:45.370">like </span><span begin="00:45.370" end="00:45.810">a </span><span begin="00:45.810" end="00:46.794">star</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.490" end="00:53.739"><span begin="00:49.490" end="00:49.722">I </span><span begin="00:49.722" end="00:49.938">don't </span><span begin="00:49.938" end="00:50.139">even </span><span begin="00:50.139" end="00:50.450">see </span><span begin="00:50.450" end="00:50.930">myself </span><span begin="00:50.930" end="00:51.482">get </span><span begin="00:51.482" end="00:53.739">old</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.130" end="00:57.586"><span begin="00:55.130" end="00:55.419">It's </span><span begin="00:55.419" end="00:55.786">hard </span><span begin="00:55.786" end="00:56.083">to </span><span begin="00:56.083" end="00:56.602">be </span><span begin="00:56.602" end="00:57.586">explained</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.962" end="00:59.970"><span begin="00:57.962" end="00:58.210">I </span><span begin="00:58.210" end="00:58.834">wanna </span><span begin="00:58.834" end="00:59.316">break </span><span begin="00:59.316" end="00:59.970">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.666" end="01:03.859"><span begin="01:00.666" end="01:01.067">I </span><span begin="01:01.067" end="01:01.451">keep </span><span begin="01:01.451" end="01:02.098">on </span><span begin="01:02.098" end="01:03.859">praying</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.403" end="01:06.299"><span begin="01:04.403" end="01:04.931">Oh </span><span begin="01:04.931" end="01:06.299">why</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.683" end="01:09.603"><span begin="01:06.683" end="01:07.026">If </span><span begin="01:07.026" end="01:07.490">my </span><span begin="01:07.490" end="01:08.786">tears </span><span begin="01:08.786" end="01:09.603">fall</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.218" end="01:15.018"><span begin="01:10.218" end="01:10.802">Down </span><span begin="01:10.802" end="01:11.370">in </span><span begin="01:11.370" end="01:12.090">my </span><span begin="01:12.090" end="01:15.018">universe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.546" end="01:20.210"><span begin="01:15.546" end="01:16.243">Turns </span><span begin="01:16.243" end="01:17.348">into </span><span begin="01:17.348" end="01:18.210">a </span><span begin="01:18.210" end="01:19.610">new </span><span begin="01:19.610" end="01:20.210">world</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.914" end="01:27.058"><span begin="01:20.914" end="01:21.482">Time </span><span begin="01:21.482" end="01:22.243">to </span><span begin="01:22.243" end="01:22.890">find </span><span begin="01:22.890" end="01:23.683">my </span><span begin="01:23.683" end="01:25.011">way </span><span begin="01:25.011" end="01:26.258">back </span><span begin="01:26.258" end="01:27.058">home</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.730" end="01:31.458"><span begin="01:27.730" end="01:28.834">Thousand </span><span begin="01:28.834" end="01:30.364">years' </span><span begin="01:30.364" end="01:31.458">gone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.458" end="01:36.427"><span begin="01:31.458" end="01:32.138">Don't </span><span begin="01:32.138" end="01:32.850">feel </span><span begin="01:32.850" end="01:34.266">nothing </span><span begin="01:34.266" end="01:35.730">no </span><span begin="01:35.730" end="01:36.427">more</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.018" end="01:41.706"><span begin="01:37.018" end="01:37.514">You're </span><span begin="01:37.514" end="01:38.363">the </span><span begin="01:38.363" end="01:38.915">one </span><span begin="01:38.915" end="01:39.762">I </span><span begin="01:39.762" end="01:40.986">long </span><span begin="01:40.986" end="01:41.706">for</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.290" end="01:45.846"><span begin="01:42.290" end="01:42.879">Now </span><span begin="01:42.879" end="01:43.632">it's </span><span begin="01:43.632" end="01:44.640">time </span><span begin="01:44.640" end="01:45.040">to </span><span begin="01:45.040" end="01:45.846">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.575" end="01:51.097"><span begin="01:47.575" end="01:47.919">I </span><span begin="01:47.919" end="01:49.086">hover </span><span begin="01:49.086" end="01:49.958">like </span><span begin="01:49.958" end="01:50.382">a </span><span begin="01:50.382" end="01:51.097">star</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.614" end="02:13.022"><span begin="02:10.614" end="02:11.086">Just </span><span begin="02:11.086" end="02:11.390">like </span><span begin="02:11.390" end="02:11.734">a </span><span begin="02:11.734" end="02:13.022">star</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.390" end="02:18.688"><span begin="02:15.390" end="02:15.726">All </span><span begin="02:15.726" end="02:16.151">the </span><span begin="02:16.151" end="02:16.910">memories </span><span begin="02:16.910" end="02:17.350">got </span><span begin="02:17.350" end="02:18.688">stuck</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.999" end="02:23.927"><span begin="02:20.999" end="02:21.351">I'm </span><span begin="02:21.351" end="02:21.671">tired </span><span begin="02:21.671" end="02:22.110">of </span><span begin="02:22.110" end="02:22.591">the </span><span begin="02:22.591" end="02:23.927">past</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.439" end="02:29.592"><span begin="02:26.439" end="02:26.782">I </span><span begin="02:26.782" end="02:27.086">want </span><span begin="02:27.086" end="02:27.425">to </span><span begin="02:27.425" end="02:27.902">break </span><span begin="02:27.902" end="02:29.592">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.070" end="02:32.582"><span begin="02:30.070" end="02:30.750">Oh </span><span begin="02:30.750" end="02:32.582">I</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.814" end="02:35.486"><span begin="02:32.814" end="02:33.159">If </span><span begin="02:33.159" end="02:33.534">my </span><span begin="02:33.534" end="02:34.647">tears </span><span begin="02:34.647" end="02:35.486">fall</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.095" end="02:40.886"><span begin="02:36.095" end="02:36.662">Down </span><span begin="02:36.662" end="02:37.350">in </span><span begin="02:37.350" end="02:38.022">my </span><span begin="02:38.022" end="02:40.886">universe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.462" end="02:46.206"><span begin="02:41.462" end="02:42.062">Turns </span><span begin="02:42.062" end="02:43.358">into </span><span begin="02:43.358" end="02:44.198">a </span><span begin="02:44.198" end="02:44.846">new </span><span begin="02:45.558" end="02:46.206">world</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.838" end="02:52.982"><span begin="02:46.838" end="02:47.318">Time </span><span begin="02:47.318" end="02:47.998">to </span><span begin="02:47.998" end="02:48.710">find </span><span begin="02:48.710" end="02:49.526">my </span><span begin="02:49.526" end="02:50.822">way </span><span begin="02:50.822" end="02:52.102">back </span><span begin="02:52.102" end="02:52.982">home</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.638" end="02:56.960"><span begin="02:53.638" end="02:54.790">Thousand </span><span begin="02:54.790" end="02:56.254">years' </span><span begin="02:56.254" end="02:56.960">gone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.487" end="03:02.294"><span begin="02:57.487" end="02:58.134">Don't </span><span begin="02:58.134" end="02:58.958">feel </span><span begin="02:58.958" end="03:00.176">nothing </span><span begin="03:00.176" end="03:01.593">no </span><span begin="03:01.593" end="03:02.294">more</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.862" end="03:07.638"><span begin="03:02.862" end="03:03.400">You're </span><span begin="03:03.400" end="03:04.206">the </span><span begin="03:04.206" end="03:04.918">one </span><span begin="03:04.918" end="03:05.575">I </span><span begin="03:05.575" end="03:06.904">long </span><span begin="03:06.904" end="03:07.638">for</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.270" end="03:11.662"><span begin="03:08.270" end="03:08.798">Now </span><span begin="03:08.798" end="03:09.599">it's </span><span begin="03:09.599" end="03:10.392">time </span><span begin="03:10.392" end="03:10.935">to </span><span begin="03:10.935" end="03:11.662">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.534" end="03:17.446"><span begin="03:13.534" end="03:14.009">I </span><span begin="03:14.009" end="03:14.982">hover </span><span begin="03:14.982" end="03:16.150">like </span><span begin="03:16.150" end="03:16.502">a </span><span begin="03:16.502" end="03:17.446">star</span></p></div></body></tt>